#ASSERT `the source of the First Schedule version read` (Date 31 8 2012) (Date 30 10 2012) EQUALS `Revised Edition 2012 text`
#ASSERT `the source of the First Schedule version read` (Date 31 8 2012) (Date 31 10 2012) EQUALS `S 549 text`
-- conduct on 30 October, 31 October and 1 November 2012, read before and after 31 October 2012
