#ASSERT `the source of the First Schedule version read` (Date 31 10 2012) (Date 30 10 2012) EQUALS `Revised Edition 2012 text`
#ASSERT `the source of the First Schedule version read` (Date 31 10 2012) (Date 31 10 2012) EQUALS `S 549 text`
