#ASSERT `the source of the First Schedule version read` (Date 1 11 2012) (Date 1 11 2012) EQUALS `S 549 text`
-- the retrospective version governs 2011 to 2024 once published
#ASSERT `the source of the First Schedule version read` (Date 1 6 2019) (Date 1 1 2020) EQUALS `S 549 text`
#ASSERT `the source of the First Schedule version read` (Date 24 9 2024) (Date 1 1 2025) EQUALS `S 549 text`
#ASSERT `the source of the First Schedule version read` (Date 25 9 2024) (Date 1 1 2025) EQUALS `consolidation text`
#ASSERT `the source of the First Schedule version read` (Date 25 9 2024) (Date 24 9 2024) EQUALS `S 549 text`
-- a reading day after the day the sources were last checked (4 November 2026, assumed, not ruled) answers NOTHING
