#ASSERT `s 31(6) the licensable broadcasting service is a relevant licensable broadcasting service, for conduct on a day, the law read as at a day` (Date 1 1 2005) (Date 1 1 2006) TRUE "Starhub Cable Vision Ltd." EQUALS JUST TRUE
