§ `Section 20(1): the dealing, the conduct day and the reading day`

-- keeping and using a set on premises one occupies, with no licence and no exemption
`keeping and using it on my own premises` MEANS
    `Dealing with apparatus` WITH `installs it in a place, or on board a ship, aircraft or vehicle registered in Singapore` IS FALSE
                                , `imports it, offers it for sale, sells it, or has it in possession with a view to sale` IS FALSE
                                , `operates it` IS TRUE
                                , `has it` IS FALSE
                                , `the place is premises in Singapore owned or occupied by the person` IS TRUE
                                , `broadcasting services are received on or by it` IS TRUE

`installing it` MEANS
    `Dealing with apparatus` WITH `installs it in a place, or on board a ship, aircraft or vehicle registered in Singapore` IS TRUE
                                , `imports it, offers it for sale, sells it, or has it in possession with a view to sale` IS FALSE
                                , `operates it` IS FALSE
                                , `has it` IS FALSE
                                , `the place is premises in Singapore owned or occupied by the person` IS FALSE
                                , `broadcasting services are received on or by it` IS FALSE

`holding it without receiving anything` MEANS
    `Dealing with apparatus` WITH `installs it in a place, or on board a ship, aircraft or vehicle registered in Singapore` IS FALSE
                                , `imports it, offers it for sale, sells it, or has it in possession with a view to sale` IS FALSE
                                , `operates it` IS FALSE
                                , `has it` IS TRUE
                                , `the place is premises in Singapore owned or occupied by the person` IS TRUE
                                , `broadcasting services are received on or by it` IS FALSE

#ASSERT `s 20(1) the person contravenes section 20(1)(a), (b) or (c), for conduct on a day, the law read as at a day, reading A` (Date 5 5 2005) (Date 1 6 2005) `equipment used for visual and aural reception` `keeping and using it on my own premises` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
